@startuml
title NOTIFY — Recruitment Event Notifications

skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActorBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam QueueBorderColor #A855F7
skinparam QueueBackgroundColor #FAF5FF

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Hiring Actor" as Actor
control "Hiring Domain" as Domain
control "RecruitmentNotificationDispatcher" as Dispatcher
control "ResultReleasePolicy" as Policy
database "Tenant DB (MySQL)" as TenantDB
queue "RabbitMQ notify-email" as RabbitMQ

note over Actor, Domain
  Preconditions: tenant ACTIVE; domain use case already committed
  (apply, move, reject, offer, invite, reminder, or score).
  WebSocket push and SMTP retry are other functions.
end note

== Domain commits then notifies ==

Actor -> Domain: Complete a hiring action
activate Actor
activate Domain
Domain -> Dispatcher: dispatch(RecruitmentNotificationEvent)
activate Dispatcher

alt RESULT_AVAILABLE and candidate must not see scores yet
  Dispatcher -> Policy: canNotifyResult(applicationId, role)
  activate Policy
  Policy --> Dispatcher: false
  deactivate Policy
  Dispatcher --> Domain: Skip candidate notification
else Recipients allowed
  Dispatcher -> Policy: canNotifyResult (no-op true for other types)
  activate Policy
  Policy --> Dispatcher: true
  deactivate Policy
  Dispatcher -> Dispatcher: Build deep link for this tenant and resource
  Dispatcher -> TenantDB: INSERT notifications (user, type, title, payload_json)
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Dispatcher: Inbox id
  deactivate TenantDB
  Dispatcher -> RabbitMQ: publish email command (X-Tenant-ID, sourceEventId)
  activate RabbitMQ
  RabbitMQ --> Dispatcher: Accepted
  deactivate RabbitMQ
  Dispatcher --> Domain: Dispatched
end

deactivate Dispatcher
Domain --> Actor: Hiring action remains committed
deactivate Domain
deactivate Actor

note over Dispatcher, RabbitMQ
  Types: APPLICATION_SUBMITTED, STAGE_CHANGED,
  APPLICATION_REJECTED, OFFER_CREATED,
  ASSESSMENT_INVITED, INTERVIEW_INVITED,
  SCHEDULE_REMINDER, RESULT_AVAILABLE.
  Inbox insert enables realtime-notification afterwards.
  Duplicate sourceEventId is handled by reliability.
end note

@enduml
